      en: ["The maximum depth of Plav Lake is approximately 9 meters.", "The average length of the lake is about 2,160 meters.", "It is the largest glacial lake in the Republic of Montenegro.", "During severe winters, the lake's surface freezes over completely.", "The lake is part of the ecological corridor of the Prokletije Mountains.", "Fish stocks are regularly monitored to maintain biodiversity."],
